{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0573_1000_p", "source_sha256": "520a34d4b0353ac2aa2bae04d7dbebc39681351ce174e6ed2ee73c3aa2b1f8e6", "ja": "ふぅ、ようやく書類が片付いたな。\nちょっと休憩でもしようかな……？", "zh": "呼，终于把文件处理完了。\n要不要稍微休息一下……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0573_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "9dfca27293de76624c29ad94eb76dd9e7eaf792cdfc345d2d3ec6486f111f92d", "ja": "お、お疲れ様です、{$P$}さん。\nいま、お時間いいですか……？", "zh": "辛、辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n现在方便吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0573_1002_p", "source_sha256": "9de74301fb16f3c66502e9faa2ccaa523cb056c0c725a2844c66fbfe5aae5ffc", "ja": "可憐、お疲れ様。もちろん構わないよ。\nどうしたんだ？", "zh": "可怜，辛苦了。当然没问题。\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0573_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "8ba6d05115264036edc232aec86c6c181d1e161d14ed55dff04d44171c1abb33", "ja": "その……最近、お忙しいみたいなので……。\n{$P$}さんに、さ、差し入れを……。", "zh": "那个……最近您好像很忙……。\n所以、所以我给{$P$}先生带了点慰问品……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0573_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "c5bda788bbd1be35c652fcd29bf23e53fb731c84e9e2d987bbc130ba1ab0b6b4", "ja": "癒しのアロマを持ってきたんです……。\nよ、よければ、休憩のおともにいかがですか……？", "zh": "我带来了舒缓身心的香薰……  \n如、如果您不嫌弃，要不要在休息时用一下……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0573_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3e4541748f47a987556ede0a4fbe95295cf7f3b3645611e912db390067078b4f", "ja": "わざわざありがとう。ちょうど休憩しようと\n思ってたから、助かるよ。", "zh": "特地拿来真是谢谢你。正好我也正想着\n要休息一下，帮大忙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0573_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "89210ea8323bb5b742da17ac8e340a7bf6a3c70f9cbb8fe5b831c65a0f2c9221", "ja": "よかった……。それじゃ、これから用意するので、\nちょっと待っていてください……♪", "zh": "太好了……那么，我现在就去准备，请稍等一下……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0573_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b02dc31c71ffc620ba19fb0255f087869a5b1ad91f2a81d1f7dddc642fed7597", "ja": "いい香りだな……。これは、チョコレート？", "zh": "好香啊……这是，巧克力？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0573_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "2896df9758dcba5543510556f009d96e2bd642e98f0b198ca7292ef5c8c5638a", "ja": "は、はい……♪\nチ、チョコの香りには、すごい効果があるんです……。", "zh": "是、是的……♪\n巧、巧克力的香气，有着非常神奇的效果……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0573_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "b47edeed3d0c76618fef1ab7ea55c2d3c280801d881394fcf081fe5b44cb82de", "ja": "ストレスを和らげたり、\n気分をリラックスさせたりしてくれるんですよ……。", "zh": "可以缓解压力，\n让心情放松下来哦……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0573_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9e429b69a5b5fe75128cd12d468896fbbd40515f4b57d6e13ce499c73ea0065a", "ja": "すぅ……おお、本当だな。\nこの甘い香り……すごく気持ちがゆったりするよ。", "zh": "吸……哦哦，真的呢。\n这股甜甜的香气……让人感觉特别放松。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0573_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "cc773c94b62c7150d7c7f29de607ec181e5acf6cf87033606c44596bf356377f", "ja": "え、えへへ。喜んでもらえて、よかった……♪", "zh": "诶、嘿嘿。你能喜欢，真是太好了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0573_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "fba2b260b8ad9aa6369dc54aace7a255efd4c1d1b022e79f369613e4aa06f475", "ja": "あ、それじゃあ……私は、失礼しますね。\n私がいたら、その、邪魔かと思うので……。", "zh": "啊，那我就……先告辞了。\n我在这里的话，那个……可能会打扰到你们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0573_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f274cd35e944bafda6fe70bae4b33ef13e14e3062f3b7fd0c030281e723912a8", "ja": "えっ！　そんなことないよ。\nたまにはのんびり、一緒に話でも……どうだ？", "zh": "咦！才不是那回事呢。偶尔一起悠闲地聊聊天……怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0573_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "869518d94b080b5472305ca8354feacf25e3cb256bd125356d00639254881607", "ja": "い、いいんですか……？　そ、それじゃ……。\n実は私も、お話ししたいことが色々あって……。", "zh": "可、可以吗……？那、那就……\n其实我也，有好多想和您聊的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0573_1015_045kar", "source_sha256": "d30fe3285a54d2ab2d21e1b165d37539486ef8eb1867817caa99396ff711a68d", "ja": "お仕事のこととか……{$P$}さんの、\nす、好きな、チョコの味とか、聞いておきたいなって♪", "zh": "工作方面的事……还有，想提前问问{$P$}先生喜、喜欢的巧克力口味之类的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
